        "initialMessages": "Hi! 👋 Welcome to ABC Co. Support.\nHow can I help you today?\n📦 Track Order\n↩️ Return Product\n💸 Refund Status\n🛍️ Product Info\n🎧 Talk to Support\nJust type one of these, or ask me anything!",
